# the SMK-37 Elite's battery: the stock firmware's thresholds on the divider's raw reading (board_caps.h; 530, 560, 602
# for one, two, three bars, where the FM-1 has 531, 561, 591), and the rough charge over 520..612 (a GUESS until the
# device is measured). The FM-1's simulator must fail this (tests/run_tests.sh)
battery 529
expect battbars 0
battery 530
expect battbars 1
battery 559
expect battbars 1
battery 560
expect battbars 2
battery 591
expect battbars 2
battery 601
expect battbars 2
battery 602
expect battbars 3
battery 520
expect battpct 0
battery 566
expect battpct 50
battery 612
expect battpct 100
battery 700
expect battpct 100
